=== 0. THE MODEL'S PAIR, AS IT STANDS ===
  alpha_as_down = 0.998000  -> eps_down =  -2.00 permil  (kinetic,     atm -> ocean)
  alpha_as_up   = 0.990000  -> eps_up   = -10.00 permil  (equilibrium, ocean -> atm)
  ⇒ the PAIR implies a steady-state surface offset d_ml - d_atm = +8.00 permil
  ⚠ NEITHER IS IN `R/constants.R`. Both are literals carrying the word
    "provisional" without being in the provisional-constant LEDGER that
    exists to track exactly this. Registering them is a prerequisite to
    changing them: an unregistered constant cannot be found by the audit.


