  SH: SST  16.00 degC (in Zhang range) | fCO3 0.0786 (in range) | seasonal SST half-amp 0.537 K

  Zhang et al. 1995, eps_DIC-g = 0.014*T*fCO3 - 0.105*T + 10.53 permil:
